[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":240},["ShallowReactive",2],{"yCQJYyeLHexeVr4U8BsMS8QomVxYVsNVsSYq8uqnw_Y":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":42,"sector":43,"services":47,"introCopy":48,"storyblockAccordions":49,"storyblockAssets":59,"flexibleContent":86,"footerLinkLabel":232,"footerLinks":233},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Harrods Toy Kingdom","A wonder-filled, gender-neutral playground where adventure, storytelling & retail collide—Shed reimagines Harrods' toy department beyond conventions",null,"harrods-toy-kingdom",false,{"hex":11},"#FFFBEF",{"hex":13},"#FF0000","Breaking gender stereotypes with an immersive retail wonderland.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Harrods Toy\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Kingdom\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":34,"height":35,"url":36,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":37},3200,1800,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":38,"srcSet":39,"src":40,"width":34,"height":35,"sizes":41},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718407911-harrods-toy-kingdom-hero.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200","(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Harrods, London",[44],{"slug":45,"label":46},"retail","Retail","Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A world of wonder, designed for discovery. By breaking steadfast category conventions, Shed reimagined Harrods&rsquo; toy department as a gender neutral, immersive playground - where adventure, storytelling and retail collide.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[50,53,56],{"title":51,"copy":52},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Balancing Harrods&rsquo; rich heritage with a bold new vision to redefine what a toy department could be. With a dual audience of children and adults - and multiple brands, conventional retail wasn&rsquo;t enough. This experience-led space needed to match Harrods&rsquo; global reputation, break the mould and be a destination in its own right.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":54,"copy":55},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A design approach that considers the duel audience, whilst maintaining a gender neutral stance across all toy categories. Storytelling wins here. A place as magical as the toys themselves. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":57,"copy":58},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>What began as a toy department, transformed into the Toy Kingdom - a series of &lsquo;dreamscapes&rsquo; from different worlds against a traditional backdrop. Imaginary worlds became tangible retail landscapes, designed to captivate and inspire.\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>The Enchanted Forest, The Big Top, Wonderland, The Odyssey &amp; The Reading Room individual spaces all knitted together and connected by a golden parquet trail - a nod to a certain yellow brick road.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[60,73,83],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":61,"videoWidth":32,"image":62},"https://player.vimeo.com/progressive_redirect/playback/1033886637/rendition/360p/file.mp4?loc=external&signature=1a64492c64f2cbd0fd603225e73cc1f83acc6a397308eddff9fe0441a1db9449",{"width":63,"height":64,"url":65,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":66},2096,1314,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":67,"srcSet":68,"src":69,"width":70,"height":71,"sizes":72},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340635-harrods-ed-07-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094",2094,1313,"(max-width: 2094px) 100vw, 2094px",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":74},{"width":75,"height":76,"url":77,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":78},1036,684,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340650-shed_ht_12-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":79,"srcSet":80,"src":81,"width":70,"height":82,"sizes":72},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340650-shed_ht_12-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340650-shed_ht_12-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340650-shed_ht_12-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&