05-shed_ht_07-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340805-shed_ht_07-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340805-shed_ht_07-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340805-shed_ht_07-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340805-shed_ht_07-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",1996,{"_modelApiKey":125,"title":126,"sideCopy":127,"mainCopy":128},"module_title_copy","THE APPROACH","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Each department anchored around an individual concept, relevant for the brands and product on offer.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003Cbr />\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A gender neutral toy department where shopping is guided by experience, not stereotypes. This world-first concept redefined retail earning widespread praise and securing a FX Award for creative retail.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":113,"asset":130},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":131},{"width":132,"height":133,"url":134,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":135},2870,1696,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":136,"srcSet":137,"src":138,"width":34,"height":139,"sizes":41},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340893-ax0-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 32