ets.com/133654/1731340996-shed_ht_13.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=1600 400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340996-shed_ht_13.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=1600 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340996-shed_ht_13.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=1600 1200w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340996-shed_ht_13.jpg?fit=crop&w=1600 1600w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731340996-shed_ht_13.jpg?fit=crop&w=1600",2028,{"_modelApiKey":113,"asset":159},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":160},{"width":116,"height":117,"url":161,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":162},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":163,"srcSet":164,"src":165,"width":34,"height":123,"sizes":41},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341032-shed_ht_15.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",{"_modelApiKey":125,"title":167,"sideCopy":168,"mainCopy":169},"THE IDEA","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The concept wasn&rsquo;t born from conventional planning or the division of boys and girl toys. Instead, immersive dreamscapes, each uniquely tailored to its department.&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjI5MzkxODI0OSwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Harrods is one of the world&rsquo;s greatest retail institutions. We were entrusted to reimagine their entire toy department - not just a place to shop, but an experience that would capture the imagination and emotional hearts of generations past, present, future.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":171,"assetPosition":172,"isWide":9,"assets":173},"module_framed_asset","right",[174],{"copy":31,"asset":175},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":176},{"width":177,"height":178,"url":179,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":180},2198,1752,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":181,"srcSet":182,"src":183,"width":184,"height":185,"sizes":186},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=1740 435w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=1740 870w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=1740 1305w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=1740 1740w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=1740 435w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=1740 870w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=1740 1305w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=1740 1740w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731341071-darkdave-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=1740",1740